| AZ-104 | Azure administration foundation | Landing zones, IaC, migration, reliability, cost, DR, operational handover |
| AZ-500 | Azure security foundation | Threat modelling, attack paths, detection engineering, incident response, security architecture |
| SC-300 | Workforce identity and access | NHI, hybrid identity migrations, tenant consolidation, customer IAM design, lifecycle operations |
| SC-500 / Cloud and AI Security | Cross-domain security | AI security, cloud detection, data protection, application security, security operations |
| AI certification track | AI workload awareness | RAG security, model access, agent identity, prompt injection, evaluation, data governance |
